# Agent Artifact Store — 機械が書く記録だけを除外する。
# 人が承認した文書（手順書、壁打ちの記録）は git で管理し、完了したら作業ツリーから
# 削除する。履歴は git で読む（docs/spec/workflow.md の「記録の置き場所」）。
/.agents/artifacts/*
!/.agents/artifacts/plans/
!/.agents/artifacts/ideas/
/.agents/artifacts/ideas/progress/
/.agents/artifacts/plans/progress/
/.agents/runtime/

# Agent runtime and scratch (machine-local per the artifact-store contract)
/.agents/runtime/
/.agents/tmp/

# Installed dependencies (the lockfile is the tracked pin, not the tree)
/node_modules/

# Python bytecode and test cache left by the skills' script suites. A user-scope
# ignore hides these on the author's machine; a fresh checkout has no such ignore.
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/

# agentic-skill-vendor working files (cache for remote sources; never committed)
/.agentic-skill-vendor/

# Session handoff written by the ba0918-handoff skill (working state, never committed)
/.agents/HANDOFF.md
